{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Which kinds of message does your contact page really get, and do the topic options match them?","Who on your team answers each topic, and who picks up press requests that come with a deadline?","Should existing customers be sent to a support channel instead, or is this form their way in?","Do you ever phone people back, or should the reply question offer email only?"],"howToUseResponses":"Sort new responses by topic and give each topic one owner, so a sales enquiry never sits in the support queue. Answer anything marked as stopping someone working first, then press requests in deadline order. Look at the topics every month: if one option keeps getting picked for messages that don't fit it, rename it or split it in two.","customizeSteps":["Rewrite the topic options in your customers' words, and keep the list to five or fewer so the choice is quick.","Change the follow-up under each topic to the one detail your team always has to ask for, such as a postcode, account number or product name.","Embed the form on your contact page, send yourself a test message for each topic, and check it reads well on a phone."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a business contact form include?","a":"A name, a company, a reply address, what the message is about and room to explain. Anything more should depend on the topic, which is why this form asks its follow-ups, such as team size or a press deadline, only of the people they apply to."},{"q":"Should press enquiries go through the main contact form?","a":"They can, as long as they are easy to spot. This form asks journalists for their outlet and deadline, so you can pick their messages out and answer them before the deadline passes."},{"q":"How do I send each enquiry to the right team?","a":"Use the topic question as your routing field. In the dashboard you can filter responses by topic, and export them to CSV if each team keeps its own list."},{"q":"Can I put this contact form on my website?","a":"Yes. Use this template to copy it into your account, edit the questions, then embed it on your contact page or link to it from a button."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":9,"title":"Business contact","description":"One contact form for buyers, customers, partners and press, each asked only what their enquiry needs.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_business00","ref":"welcome","title":"Hello, and thanks for getting in touch. Pick what your message is about and we'll pass it to the team that handles it.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_business01","ref":"contact","title":"First, who are we talking to?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","last_name","email"]},{"id":"blk_business02","ref":"company","title":"Which company or organisation are you with?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_business03","ref":"topic","title":"What's your message about?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_buying_from_us","label":"Buying from us","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_help_with_something","label":"Help with something you already have","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_partnership_or","label":"A partnership or supplier offer","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_press_or_media","label":"Press or media","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_else","label":"Something else","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_business04","ref":"interest","title":"Which product or service are you interested in?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":200},{"id":"blk_business05","ref":"team_size","title":"How many people would be using it?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"dropdown","options":[{"id":"opt_just_me","label":"Just me","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_2_10","label":"2–10","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_11_50","label":"11–50","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_51_250","label":"51–250","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_more_than_250","label":"More than 250","image_key":null}]},{"id":"blk_business06","ref":"timeline","title":"When are you hoping to get started?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_as_soon_as","label":"As soon as possible","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_in_the_next","label":"In the next few months","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_just_exploring_for","label":"Just exploring for now","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_business07","ref":"reference","title":"Do you have an order, account or ticket number?","description":"Leave it blank if you don't have one to hand.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":80},{"id":"blk_business08","ref":"urgency","title":"How urgent is it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_it_s_stopping","label":"It's stopping us working","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_s_getting","label":"It's getting in the way","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_can_wait","label":"It can wait a few days","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_business09","ref":"partner_type","title":"What kind of partnership are you proposing?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_reselling_or_referring","label":"Reselling or referring our products","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_supplying_us","label":"Supplying us","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_working_to